        }
      ],
      "message": "contrib: add PIP-2030 Quantum Shield toolset (ML-DSA-65, C++)\n\nStandalone experimental toolset implementing NIST FIPS 204 ML-DSA-65\n(CRYSTALS-Dilithium Mode 3 equivalent) via liboqs:\n- pq-shield: keygen/sign/verify CLI\n- pq-shield-audit: key size and permission (0600) validation\n- ctest round-trip, tamper-resistance and permissions tests\n\nAdditive only; no consensus changes. Foundation for post-quantum\nsignature output experimentation ahead of a Shor-vs-secp256k1\ncryptographically relevant quantum computer.",
